14505      ;
14506      proc logistic data=Neuralgia;
14507      class Treatment Sex;
14508      model Pain= Treatment Sex Treatment*Sex Age Duration / expb;
14509      run;

NOTE: PROC LOGISTIC is modeling the probability that Pain='No'. One way to change this to model the probability that Pain='Yes' is to specify the response 
      variable option EVENT='Yes'.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: Under full-rank parameterizations, Type 3 effect tests are replaced by joint tests. The joint test for an effect is a test that all the parameters 
      associated with that effect are zero. Such joint tests might not be equivalent to Type 3 effect tests under GLM parameterization.
NOTE: There were 60 observations read from the data set WORK.NEURALGIA.
